-- the interface carried across the equivalence (PLAN.md revision 7.9, 6 Nov 2026, git 2ca8d747aaa5:PLAN.md, §18.10 “C20–C22 — Memory and state”, its part C22, and §12 “The build list”, “C. Memory and state”, item 22): a program written against Fin n → Int64
-- uses application and the functional update fin-set; under atab they are index and update, so a
-- program on functions is the program on arrays along the paths below
fin-set : (n : Nat) → (Fin n → Int64) → Fin n → Int64 → Fin n → Int64
fin-set n f p v = λ q → if eqb (fst p) (fst q) then v else f q
